    "Try the voice input on a real day. The AI is forgiving, you can ramble through \"tired, had wine and pasta, took ibuprofen at 4, felt better by 8\" and it'll log all four." to "Essaie la saisie vocale un vrai jour. L'IA est indulgente : tu peux dire « fatigué, vin et pâtes, ibuprofène à 16 h, mieux vers 20 h » et elle note les quatre.",
